    "homeType": "CONDO",
    "description": "Exceptional Top-Floor, West-Facing Two-Bedroom Residence at Broderick Place. A rare opportunity in one of NoPa's most sought-after buildings, this beautifully appointed condominium offers an elevated standard of modern living. Bathed in natural light, the home features nice western views of Buena Vista Park and the USF campus, high-end finishes throughout, and custom closets, including a spacious walk-in. Built in 2006, Broderick Place offers a thoughtfully curated suite of on-site amenities and neighborhood conveniences. Enjoy gourmet grocery shopping at Faletti Foods, dine at celebrated local favorites like Nopalito and RT Rotisserie, grab a morning coffee at Peet's, or a fresh bagel from Schlok's, all just steps from your front door. Ideally located at the edge of the Panhandle and Golden Gate Park, outdoor recreation is at your doorstep. The Divisadero Corridor, known for its vibrant culinary and nightlife scene, adds to the neighborhood's dynamic appeal. Commuters will appreciate the property's proximity to downtown (FiDi) and the easy access to both tech and biotech shuttle stops just one block away. This home effortlessly combines luxury, lifestyle, and location, truly city living at its best."
  },
